                    {
                      "id": "ccce94bf-ab6e-4563-b752-9245e2ca0e54",
                      "text": "文档: An extensionality lemma that is useful for filters with good lemmas about `sᶜ ∈…",
                      "children": [],
                      "isExpanded": true,
                      "parentId": "0b9e36f1-e4af-42c6-ab8a-f02372afca15",
                      "data": {
                        "note": "**文档**\n\nAn extensionality lemma that is useful for filters with good lemmas about `sᶜ ∈ f` (e.g.,\n`Filter.comap`, `Filter.coprod`, `Filter.Coprod`, `Filter.cofinite`).",
                        "tags": [
                          "attribute",
                          "文档"
                        ]
                      },
                      "style": {
