                    {
                      "id": "4cfc777a-da27-42c2-9f39-c6bed46f1d07",
                      "text": "文档: A filter `F` on a type `α` is a collection of sets of `α` which contains the wh…",
                      "children": [],
                      "isExpanded": true,
                      "parentId": "9bda39c7-cfe0-4f8e-b5f3-b1df59419ebf",
                      "data": {
                        "note": "**文档**\n\nA filter `F` on a type `α` is a collection of sets of `α` which contains the whole `α`,\nis upwards-closed, and is stable under intersection. We do not forbid this collection to be\nall sets of `α`.",
                        "tags": [
                          "attribute",
                          "文档"
                        ]
                      },
                      "style": {
