                        },
                        {
                          "id": "4d70441f-9f27-4200-a620-a65a05767971",
                          "text": "文档: A set is a collection of elements of some type `α`. Although `Set` is defined a…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "745d30ad-13e8-48bc-83c0-498337d765a4",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\nA set is a collection of elements of some type `α`.\n\nAlthough `Set` is defined as `α → Prop`, this is an implementation detail which should not be\nrelied on. Instead, `Set.ofPred` (also written `{x | p x}`) and membership of a set (`∈`) should be\nused to convert between sets and predicates.",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "文档"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "isExpanded": false,
                      "parentId": "30d5cc6b-fcfd-461c-af8a-1bda4ac2386e",
                      "data": {
                        "tags": [
                          "attribute-group"
                        ]
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "background": "#f3f4f6",
                        "color": "#4b5563",
                        "fontSize": 12,
                        "shape": "round",
                        "borderColor": "#d1d5db"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "2d4034d1-a3c5-4ef2-b9ed-7df296902f56",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Data.Set.Defs`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nType u → Type u\n```\n\n**文档**\nA set is a collection of elements of some type `α`.\n\nAlthough `Set` is defined as `α → Prop`, this is an implementation detail which should not be\nrelied on. Instead, `Set.ofPred` (also written `{x | p x}`) and membership of a set (`∈`) should be\nused to convert between sets and predicates.",
                    "tags": [
                      "declaration",
                      "陈述",
                      "definition"
                    ]
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "background": "#f8fbff",
                    "color": "#1e3a8a",
                    "fontSize": 13,
                    "borderColor": "#93c5fd"
                  }
