                        {
                          "id": "4d719bb1-a2c6-41ad-ac74-3ff7235c8009",
                          "text": "文档: If and only if, or logical bi-implication. `a ↔ b` means that `a` implies `b` a…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "85bbdf77-20f5-4f1c-a019-1e6cb1f60c97",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\nIf and only if, or logical bi-implication. `a ↔ b` means that `a` implies `b` and vice versa.\nBy `propext`, this implies that `a` and `b` are equal and hence any expression involving `a`\nis equivalent to the corresponding expression with `b` instead.",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "文档"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "isExpanded": false,
                      "parentId": "a7800ff1-8081-41a0-b2e4-08b1946c6c25",
                      "data": {
                        "tags": [
