                        {
                          "id": "0f50f1b7-34b9-4881-8f3b-52f9c683782b",
                          "text": "签名: {α : Type u} → [toDistribLattice : DistribLattice α] → [toCompl : Compl α] → [t…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "419c35b7-8fbc-4ce7-aa18-64e15b3aee69",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**签名**\n\n{α : Type u} → [toDistribLattice : DistribLattice α] → [toCompl : Compl α] → [toSDiff : SDiff α] → [toHImp : HImp α] → [toTop : Top α] → [toBot : Bot α] → (∀ (x : α), x ⊓ xᶜ ≤ ⊥) → (∀ (x : α), ⊤ ≤ x ⊔ xᶜ) → (∀ (a : α), a ≤ ⊤) → (∀ (a : α), ⊥ ≤ a) → autoParam (∀ (x y : α), x \\ y = x ⊓ yᶜ) BooleanAlgebra.sdiff_eq._autoParam → autoParam (∀ (x y : α), x ⇨ y = y ⊔ xᶜ) BooleanAlgebra.himp_eq._autoParam → BooleanAlgebra α",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "签名"
                            ]
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "background": "#f9fafb",
                            "color": "#6b7280",
                            "fontSize": 11,
                            "borderColor": "#e5e7eb"
                          }
                        },
