            {
              "id": "063b6b11-9bee-43e2-b377-9cfc0ee93322",
              "text": "文档: An extensionality lemma that is useful for filters with good lemmas about `sᶜ ∈…",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "2191d24e-1cd9-45f9-bdf9-0ac4256fb2cc",
              "data": {
